      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/65b543/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2016-11-29T02:10:14.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I assume Resolute-&gt;Prayer of Desperation follows the same guidelines as Don't Dismiss Anything-&gt;Know When to Hold Fast, which was ruled in the Fireside Chat as DDA allowing to finish before ending the turn.</p>",
