      "raw": "<p>I assume Resolute-&gt;Prayer of Desperation follows the same guidelines as Don&#39;t Dismiss Anything-&gt;Know When to Hold Fast, which was ruled in the Fireside Chat as DDA allowing to finish before ending the turn.</p>",
